  "core_idea": "Culture is a web of meanings that people spin. The researcher's task is thick description: interpreting what actions and symbols mean to those who perform them, as one reads a text.",
  "key_concepts_note": "Use the concepts already stored for this theory in the library (theories.concepts).",
  "when_to_use": [
    "What do rituals, practices or symbols mean in a community?",
    "How do people interpret an event or institution?",
    "Typical data: ethnography, participant observation, interviews."
  ],
  "common_mistakes": [
    "Using 'thick description' to mean long description.",
    "Imposing the researcher's meanings.",
    "Ignoring power behind meanings."
